### 0. Test API Guide
GET http://localhost:3000/
### 1. Test Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 2. Test GET all records
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records

### 3. Test POST (Create a new record)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Broken window in Lab 2",
  "category": "Furniture",
  "description": "The window latch is broken and cold air is coming in.",
  "status": "Pending"
}

### 4. Test POST (Invalid Input - Missing title)
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:3000/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Electrical",
  "description": "This should fail because title is missing.",
  "status": "Pending"
}

### 5. Test GET one record (Replace 9 with the ID from Test 3)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records/9

### 6. Test PUT (Update record 9)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/records/9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fixed window in Lab 2",
  "category": "Furniture",
  "description": "The window latch has been replaced.",
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 7. Test DELETE (Delete record 9)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/records/9

### 8. Test GET one record again (Should now be 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records/9